          "section_id": "c_sections.1",
          "heading": "what_we_did",
          "source_ids": [
            "sections.2",
            "sections.3"
          ],
          "text": "The team checked that the blood supply and feeling in your hand were intact. You had a supporting plaster put on your wrist. On day 1, you had an operation to fix the broken bone. This is called an ORIF. The operation went without any problems."
        },
